{"images":[],"manifest":{"budgetTokens":15000,"countMethod":"proxy","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","packSha":"a8999ada94c1c846634a5a4f7f280205dad570e1fd9ba79f5d773820d378706b","packTokens":2281,"recipeVersion":"1","redactions":0,"sections":[{"id":"tpl","tokens":67,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"},{"id":"spans","tokens":357,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"answers","tokens":705,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"sentences","tokens":1082,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"task","tokens":8,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"}],"stage":"round-trip"},"pointers":[],"system":"Map each restated sentence to the original intent spans (I-n) and answers (Q-n) it comes from. A sentence that matches none gets empty lists. Every sentence n must appear once.","tools":[],"user":"<artifact id=\"spans\" kind=\"intent\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-1\",\n  \"text\": \"When an invoice is 7 days past its due date, the system shall mark it overdue and show it on the overdue list\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-2\",\n  \"text\": \"When staff press 'Send reminder' on an overdue invoice, the system shall email the customer a reminder with the invoice number, amount and due date\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-3\",\n  \"text\": \"The system shall record each reminder sent, with who sent it and when, and show the history on the invoice\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-4\",\n  \"text\": \"If an email cannot be delivered, the system shall show the failure on the invoice and keep it on the overdue list\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-5\",\n  \"text\": \"Staff shall be able to filter the overdue list by customer and by days overdue\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-6\",\n  \"text\": \"Build overdue list screen (table, filters, a 'Send reminder' button per row)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"I-7\",\n  \"text\": \"Build invoice detail screen (amount, due date, reminder history, delivery failures)\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"answers\" kind=\"answers\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-1\",\n  \"question\": \"Who can view the screens and send reminders, and how do staff sign in?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Any authenticated staff user, using the existing API's authentication\",\n  \"by\": \"mhamza\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-2\",\n  \"question\": \"Which email address receives the reminder, and what happens if the customer has several contacts or none?\",\n  \"answer\": \"The customer's single billing email from the existing record; if missing, the send is blocked with an error\",\n  \"by\": \"mhamza\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-3\",\n  \"question\": \"Can reminder history entries be edited or deleted?\",\n  \"answer\": \"No, they are append-only and immutable\",\n  \"by\": \"mhamza\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-4\",\n  \"question\": \"Payments are out of scope. So how does an invoice come off the overdue list once it is paid or closed?\",\n  \"answer\": \"The existing system's invoice status (paid/cancelled) is read and closed invoices drop off automatically\",\n  \"by\": \"mhamza\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-5\",\n  \"question\": \"How should repeated sends be guarded against?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Disable the button while a send is in progress only\",\n  \"by\": \"mhamza\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"question\": \"Is 'overdue' a status saved on the invoice (for example by a daily job), or is it worked out from the due date each time the list loads?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Computed at query time from due date and today's date\",\n  \"by\": \"mhamza\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"question\": \"Where are reminder history records stored, given that invoices live in the client's existing system?\",\n  \"answer\": \"New table in the same Postgres database, referencing invoice ID\",\n  \"by\": \"mhamza\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"question\": \"Is a failed send recorded in the append-only reminder history, and does a later successful send clear the failure shown on the invoice?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Every attempt (success or failure) is a history entry; the latest status is shown\",\n  \"by\": \"mhamza\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"sentences\" kind=\"restated\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"n\": 1,\n  \"text\": \"Add logic that classifies an invoice as overdue by computing it on every request without storing it, based on whether its status is in a configured open-status list (default 'open'), it has a due date, and the calendar days from due date to today in a configured business time zone meet or exceed a configured overdue threshold (default 7).\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 2,\n  \"text\": \"Add an API endpoint that returns, for authenticated staff users, the list of currently overdue invoices, each with invoice ID, invoice number, customer name, amount, due date, days overdue and latest reminder outcome.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 3,\n  \"text\": \"Allow the overdue list request to be filtered by customer, returning only that customer's overdue invoices.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 4,\n  \"text\": \"Allow the overdue list request to be filtered by a fixed days-overdue bucket (7-30, 31-60, 61+), returning invoices in that bucket, and return a 400 validation error if an unrecognized bucket value is given.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 5,\n  \"text\": \"Add a send-reminder action that, for an overdue invoice whose customer has a billing email, sends one templated email via the configured email sender to that billing email from the configured sender address, including invoice number, amount in local currency and due date.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 6,\n  \"text\": \"When the customer has no billing email, make the send-reminder action send no email, return a 'missing billing email' error, and record the attempt as a failed entry in reminder history.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 7,\n  \"text\": \"When the invoice is not overdue (including paid or cancelled invoices), make the send-reminder action return a 409 error, send no email, and add no reminder history entry.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 8,\n  \"text\": \"After each reminder send attempt, add one row to a reminder history table recording invoice ID, sending staff user ID, server UTC timestamp, outcome (sent/failed), and failure reason when applicable.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 9,\n  \"text\": \"Make all requests to edit or delete a reminder history entry respond with 404 or 405 and leave the entry unchanged.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 10,\n  \"text\": \"Add an invoice detail endpoint returning invoice number, customer name, amount, due date, overdue flag, days overdue, latest reminder outcome, and full reminder history newest first with sender, timestamp, outcome and failure reason.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 11,\n  \"text\": \"When the email sender errors, make the response report outcome 'failed' with the error reason, record a failed history entry with that reason, and keep the invoice in the overdue list.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 12,\n  \"text\": \"Require valid staff authentication on every Invoice Reminders endpoint, rejecting unauthenticated requests with 401 and no data change or email sent.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 13,\n  \"text\": \"Return 404 with no email sent and no history row added when an invoice detail or send-reminder request names a non-existent invoice ID.\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\nMap the sentences."}